1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,438
This is the showcase app that comes with
the framework: a complete mobile game UI,

2
00:00:05,438 --> 00:00:08,388
built only from what you've seen in the
tutorial.

3
00:00:08,388 --> 00:00:11,700
Every screen is its own scene, loaded when
it's needed.

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,357
Four tabs under a shared top bar and nav
bar.

5
00:00:16,357 --> 00:00:22,357
The tabs slide in the direction you're
going, and the bars never move.

6
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:37,100
Popups sit on top of whatever is open: a
reward with confetti, coins flying into
the

7
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,929
top bar, a purchase sheet, settings.

8
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:52,735
And every bit of it is set up in the same
window.

9
00:00:52,735 --> 00:00:56,020
Change an animation, press Play, done.

10
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:58,786
Clone the repository and try it.
